  <item>
    <title>夏窗特别篇丨阿尔特塔手握3亿？赖斯来队概率80%？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647f35ab6752b5f9de17a820</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647f35ab6752b5f9de17a820</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Jun 2023 13:33:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为爱发电《厂长会客厅》栏目，一刀不剪完整音频版正式上线！</span></p><span></span><p><span>鉴于不少枪迷私信给我，说是希望可以听到这个栏目的完整版，那么我们便满足大家这个愿望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从这期开始，我们会尽量把完整音频通过播客的形式上传到这里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢各位枪迷的支持！新赛季我们再出发！COYG！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 正式录制前和阿比古达的闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 正片开始&amp;嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 夏窗到底有多少钱可以花？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 关于赖斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">23:16</a> 京多安更适合？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 凯塞多的可能性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 其他位置上的引援？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 蒂尔尼离队的可能性和影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> 新赛季的锋线配置（巴洛贡还有机会吗？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 扎卡和托马斯万一同时离队，对新赛季开局的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3409">56:49</a> 大家最希望哪位球员可以加盟？</span></p>]]></description>
